ding complex are generally considered to be the world's oldest monumental structures constructed of dressed masonry.[8]"},{"title":"Garden Gathering","address":"Nasr City, Cairo","image":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","_id":"68bed9f417124947e22b808c","description":"This charming garden gathering offers a tranquil escape from the city bustle. Picture an evening of vibrant conversations under a canopy of twinkling fairy lights, surrounded by the sweet fragrance of blooming jasmine. Settle into a cozy nook among lush ferns and colorful petunias, with the gentle murmur of a nearby fountain as your soundtrack. This is a chance to reconnect with old friends and make new ones in a serene, natural setting. Enjoy a selection of artisanal refreshments and light bites as you soak in the peaceful, enchanting atmosphere. It's an invitation to slow down, breathe, and appreciate the simple beauty of nature in good company."}]},"__N_SSG":true}